{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "42aee2a4-9513-8794-9487-75998b88a912",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T11:34:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Gino Grasso. I'm calling about a Christmas tree pickup. Basically, I've got a tree still sitting at the curb at one of my rental properties and it hasn't been collected."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:31:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is this the tree you put out after the holidays, or did you put it out recently?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:31:57-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been out there since the first week of January. And it's the second miss in a row, basically. The tenants put it out for the first scheduled pickup, nothing. Then they put it back out for the next one, and still nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:32:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Was it bagged, or was it loose at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:32:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loose. No bag. I thought that was how it was supposed to go. Is it supposed to be bagged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually trees go out loose, no plastic bag, and no stand or lights or tinsel on it. Any of that left on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:32:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I don't think so. I'd have to check with the tenants about the tinsel. The lights, no. They took those off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sometimes the crew skips one if there's anything left on it, or if it's sitting behind a snowbank or too close to the bins. Was there any of that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not behind a snowbank, no. It's right at the curb next to the barrels. Sorry, one sec, I'm just heating up some food. We've still got a ton of leftovers from the holiday dinner and I'm working through them at lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Newport's been a little behind on a few routes, so I'll put in a request for a pickup on that tree. I just need the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so I'd rather not get into the address on this call. Is there another way to flag it? Like can the tenants just call it in themselves?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do need a location to send the crew, otherwise I can't log it. If you'd rather, the tenants can call and give it, or you can call back when you have it handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. I'll have them call. Basically, what should I tell them? Same thing, loose tree, nothing on it, at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Tree at the curb by the regular trash spot, no bag, no decorations, and tell them it's been missed twice. That helps get it moved up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is there a cutoff? Like, is it too late in the season for them to still pick up trees?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say for sure what the cutoff is this year. When they call we'll see what the crew can do, and if it's past the collection window they'll tell them how else to get rid of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should I leave a callback number in case someone wants to reach me too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0178. I'll note that you called about the tree and that a request is coming from the tenants."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. That's all I needed. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Enjoy those leftovers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
